  "description": "Discover the ultimate blend of convenience and adventure with the Biktrix Kutty LT 3 folding EBike! This compact powerhouse boasts a robust 750W rear hub motor and an impressive 52V16Ah battery, delivering incredible range and performance. Perfect for urban commuters, the Kutty LT 3 effortlessly tackles most terrain with its 4\" fat tires and 60mm travel suspension fork. When your journey ends, simply fold it up and tuck it away - it's that easy! Equipped with quad-piston hydraulic disc brakes, an integrated headlight, and a user-friendly LCD display, this EBike offers both safety and style. Whether you're navigating city streets or exploring the roads, the Kutty LT 3 promises an exhilarating ride that will revolutionize your daily commute and weekend adventures!",
